    "transcripts": [
      {
        "card_id": "004101",
        "transcript": "I am generally positive about the proposal, although we still need a clearer timeline.",
        "target_signal": "区分正向主态度与保留条件",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "004102",
        "transcript": "I'm cautiously optimistic about the new assessment method, but I need to see one full semester of results.",
        "target_signal": "综合程度副词和证据条件判断谨慎支持",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "004103",
        "transcript": "The response rate was lower than expected, and frankly that result is disappointing for all of us.",
        "target_signal": "区分结果事实与直接态度评价",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "004104",
        "transcript": "I'm not against the plan, but I can't fully support it until we clarify the budget assumptions.",
        "target_signal": "还原起点—转折—条件的保留态度链",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "004105",
        "transcript": "Despite a few concerns, I still believe the benefits of this change outweigh the drawbacks.",
        "target_signal": "用让步与主句权重判断总体方向",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "004106",
        "transcript": "I was skeptical at first, but after seeing the pilot outcomes, I now support moving ahead with a phased rollout.",
        "target_signal": "复述初始态度、证据和当前立场",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "004107",
        "transcript": "Honestly, I think the new policy is quite reasonable. It's long overdue, if you ask me.",
        "target_signal": "区分政策赞同与对实施过晚的不满",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "004108",
        "transcript": "I'm somewhat skeptical about the results of that survey. The sample size was really quite small, and I'm not sure it's representative.",
        "target_signal": "把怀疑态度绑定到样本代表性依据",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "004109",
        "transcript": "I have to say, I'm pretty impressed with how quickly the team turned things around. No one expected that kind of turnaround in just two weeks.",
        "target_signal": "利用超预期与时间信息判断赞赏强度",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "004110",
        "transcript": "To be frank, I think we're wasting a lot of time on this issue. We should have moved on ages ago.",
        "target_signal": "识别针对讨论拖延的不耐烦与批评",
        "pronunciation_notes": "No dedicated pronunciation phenomenon; verify clear standard pronunciation across the complete transcript.",
        "text_review_result": "passed_before_perceptual_review"
      },
      {
        "card_id": "004111",
        "transcript": "She seems quite neutral about the whole thing, which is actually surprising given how vocal she usually is about environmental issues.",
        "target_signal": "区分被描述者态度与说话人元态度",
